message: "If you use this software or the FedPartBE algorithm, please cite it as below."
title: "FedLab ZMQ: Energy-Efficient Federated Learning on Constrained IoT Devices"
abstract: >-
  A federated learning research framework with realistic battery simulation,
  heterogeneous device profiles, and a centralized compute-cost model
  (hardware/flop_cost.py). Includes FedPartBE, a battery-aware partial-network
  update algorithm, and the phi / corrected / measured cost-model methodology.
